<section id="process" data-surface="dark" aria-labelledby="process-title" class="relative bg-charcoal text-bone" style="height:380vh"><div class="sticky top-0 flex h-screen flex-col overflow-hidden px-[6vw] pb-8 pt-24 supports-[height:100svh]:h-svh md:pb-12 md:pt-28"><div class="flex items-center gap-5 text-bone/70"><p class="mono-label whitespace-nowrap">04<!-- --> — <!-- -->Process</p><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px flex-1 bg-current opacity-20"></span><p class="mono-label whitespace-nowrap">01 / 04</p></div><div class="mt-6 grid min-h-0 flex-1 grid-rows-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-6 md:mt-10 md:grid-cols-12 md:grid-rows-1 md:gap-10"><div class="flex flex-col md:col-span-5 md:justify-center"><h2 id="process-title" data-reveal="" class="font-heading text-[clamp(2.4rem,min(5vw,8.5vh),5.25rem)] leading-[0.92] tracking-[-0.015em]"><span class="reveal-line"><span style="transition-delay:0s">From lump</span></span><span class="reveal-line"><span style="transition-delay:0.1s">to kiln.</span></span></h2><ol class="mt-8 hidden md:mt-10 md:block"><li class="border-t border-bone/15"><button type="button" aria-current="step" class="group flex w-full items-baseline gap-6 py-4 text-left xl:py-5"><span class="w-14 font-heading text-[2.25rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-terracotta">01</span><span class="flex-1"><span class="block font-heading text-[2rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone">Wedge</span></span><span class="mono-label transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone">20 min</span></button><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-1000 ease-soft grid-rows-[1fr] opacity-100"><p class="overflow-hidden pb-0 pl-20 text-[0.975rem] leading-relaxed text-bone/70"><span class="block pb-6">Every throw starts at the bench. The clay is folded and pressed in a slow spiral until the air is gone and the body feels the same all the way through. Skip it and the kiln finds every bubble.</span></p></div></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-baseline gap-6 py-4 text-left xl:py-5"><span class="w-14 font-heading text-[2.25rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/25 group-hover:text-bone/50">02</span><span class="flex-1"><span class="block font-heading text-[2rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40 group-hover:text-bone/70">Throw</span></span><span class="mono-label transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40">1 hr</span></button><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-1000 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><p class="overflow-hidden pb-0 pl-20 text-[0.975rem] leading-relaxed text-bone/70"><span class="block pb-6">Centred, opened, pulled, shaped. One vessel at a time on the wheel, then left under cloth overnight to firm up before the foot is trimmed by hand.</span></p></div></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-baseline gap-6 py-4 text-left xl:py-5"><span class="w-14 font-heading text-[2.25rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/25 group-hover:text-bone/50">03</span><span class="flex-1"><span class="block font-heading text-[2rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40 group-hover:text-bone/70">Dry &amp; Bisque</span></span><span class="mono-label transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40">7–10 days</span></button><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-1000 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><p class="overflow-hidden pb-0 pl-20 text-[0.975rem] leading-relaxed text-bone/70"><span class="block pb-6">Pieces dry slowly on pine shelves so the walls shrink evenly. The first firing, to 950 °C, turns fragile clay into something porous and permanent.</span></p></div></li><li class="border-t border-bone/15"><button type="button" class="group flex w-full items-baseline gap-6 py-4 text-left xl:py-5"><span class="w-14 font-heading text-[2.25rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/25 group-hover:text-bone/50">04</span><span class="flex-1"><span class="block font-heading text-[2rem] leading-none transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40 group-hover:text-bone/70">Glaze &amp; Fire</span></span><span class="mono-label transition-colors duration-700 ease-soft text-bone/40">36 hrs</span></button><div class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows,opacity] duration-1000 ease-soft grid-rows-[0fr] opacity-0"><p class="overflow-hidden pb-0 pl-20 text-[0.975rem] leading-relaxed text-bone/70"><span class="block pb-6">Each piece is dipped in glazes we mix in the studio, fired to 1240 °C and left to cool for a day and a half. Opening the kiln never gets old.</span></p></div></li></ol></div><div class="relative flex min-h-0 flex-col md:col-span-6 md:col-start-7"><div class="relative min-h-0 flex-1"><svg viewBox="0 0 480 480" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" data-active="true" class="transition-opacity duration-700 ease-soft opacity-100 absolute inset-0 m-auto h-full max-h-[34rem] w-full max-w-[34rem] text-bone"><path d="M92 446V346H32V330H448V346H388V446" pathLength="1" class="draw-path" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="transition-delay:0.15s"></path><path d="M150 330C138 296 152 258 192 248C226 240 258 239 292 247C334 257 350 300 336 330" pathLength="1" class="draw-path" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="transition-delay:0.43000000000000005s"></path><path d="M226 246C234 270 236 300 230 330M258 245C250 270 250 300 256 330" pathLength="1" class="draw-path" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="transition-delay:0.7100000000000001s"></path><path d="M200 304C186 300 180 284 190 274C200 264 216 268 218 282C220 294 208 300 200 292C194 286 198 278